#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php
msgid "Xorro Direct Wallet Payments for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Pagamentos diretos da carteira Xorro para WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php
msgid "https://github.com/x-o-r-r-o/xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce"
msgstr "https://github.com/x-o-r-r-o/xorro-direct-wallet-pagamentos-woocommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php
msgid "Accept cryptocurrency payments directly to your own wallets — no third-party payment processor. Supports BTC, BCH, ETH, USDT, USDC, DAI, TON, ADA, APT, KAS, XTZ and 200+ coins/tokens with automatic on-chain verification."
msgstr "Aceite pagamentos de criptomoeda diretamente para suas carteiras. Nenhum processador de pagamento de terceiros. Suporta BTC, BCH, ETH, USDT, USDC, DAI, TON, ADA, APT, KAS, XTZ e mais de 200 moedas / fichas com verificação automática on-chain."

#. Author of the plugin
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php
msgid "xorro"
msgstr "xorro"

